--- a/boxrun.1
+++ b/boxrun.1
@@ -749,6 +749,13 @@
 Accepts a group name or numeric GID.
 .It Fl Fl hostname Ar name
 Set the hostname inside the sandbox.
+.It Fl Fl chdir Ar dir
+Set the working directory inside the sandbox.  By default the
+sandboxed command starts in
+.Pa /
+; this option changes that to
+.Ar dir
+(which must be visible inside the sandbox, e.g. via a bind mount).
 .El
 .Ss Other Options
 .Bl -tag -width indent
